## Run Primary and Secondary User
```bash
python src/primary-user.py <pluto-uri>
python src/secondary-user.py <pluto-uri>
```

## What more ?
- Need to design how SU gets to know which channel the assigned PU is occupying.
- Information from all the SUs will be given to the fusion server. So fusion server needs to be implemented.
- 64 frequency points for each band. (Probably achieved by OFDM signal)
- Asynchronous file I/O if computation within while loop of SU is taking significant time.